1
00:00:00,875 --> 00:00:03,545
(Mrs Cooper:)I know how to take care of my baby.

2
00:00:03,712 --> 00:00:08,052
(Mrs Cooper:)His eyes came out a little thin,
but you can just pretend he's Chinese.

3
00:00:11,886 --> 00:00:14,726
(Mrs Cooper:)So do you want to talk
about what happened...

4
00:00:14,889 --> 00:00:16,809
(Mrs Cooper:)...with you and your little friends?

5
00:00:17,350 --> 00:00:19,730
(Sheldon:)-They're not my friends.
-All right.

6
00:00:20,478 --> 00:00:21,808
[MARY CHUCKLES]

7
00:00:22,397 --> 00:00:26,487
(Mrs Cooper:)If you recall, when you were little
we sat right here at this very spot...

8
00:00:26,651 --> 00:00:30,531
...and talked about the problems you had
getting along with the neighbor kids.

9
00:00:30,697 --> 00:00:33,697
(Sheldon:)That was different. They were
threatened by my intelligence...

10
00:00:33,867 --> 00:00:36,867
(Sheldon:)...and too stupid to know
that's why they hated me.

11
00:00:38,913 --> 00:00:42,083
(Mrs Cooper:)Oh, baby, they knew very well
why they hated you.

12
00:00:53,511 --> 00:00:55,761
(Howard:)I can't believe
you bought a red cowboy hat.

13
00:00:55,930 --> 00:01:03,020
(Howard:)Hello? I'm wearing a red turtleneck.

